on (spell flag)\">IsConcentration</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsEnemySpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsEnemySpell (spell flag)\">IsEnemySpell</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Grappled_.28Vine.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Grappled_(Vine)\"> Condition: Grappled (Vine) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grappled_(Vine)_(Condition)\" title=\"Grappled (Vine) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grappled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grappled_(Vine)_(Condition)\" title=\"Grappled (Vine) (Condition)\">Grappled</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(status_group)\" title=\"Incapacitated (status group)\">incapacitated</a> and cannot be damaged while held within the grapple. <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/20px-Help_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/30px-Help_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/40px-Help_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Help\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/20px-Help_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Help_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\">Help</a> it to free it!</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Grappling\"> Condition: Grappling </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grappling_(Condition)\" title=\"Grappling (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grappling\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grappling_(Condition)\" title=\"Grappling (Condition)\">Grappling</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has <a href=\"/wiki/Grappled_(Condition)\" title=\"Grappled (Condition)\">Grappled</a> another creature. Cannot move while Grappling. Interrupted by receiving damage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Creeper\" title=\"Shadow Creeper\">Shadow Creeper</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This bonus action can only be performed after the Shadow Creeper uses its <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715060943\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.075 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.082 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3005/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 44141/